WEBVTT

00:02.000 --> 00:06.440
"Nil Kamui \ Orphanage on

00:02.000 --> 00:06.440
the outskirts of Shuka"

00:07.700 --> 00:10.440
Friend? Me?

00:10.440 --> 00:11.840
Yes.

00:11.840 --> 00:13.710
My name is Lou Chun Wah.

00:13.710 --> 00:15.680
I hope to be of assistance.

00:15.680 --> 00:17.850
I'm...

00:17.850 --> 00:19.410
Ibuki, right?

00:19.410 --> 00:22.280
You were recommended to the Red Dragon expedition.

00:22.280 --> 00:24.020
I see!

00:24.020 --> 00:27.790
So you're the other member of the expedition.

00:33.290 --> 00:36.130
The name of our country is Nil Kamui.

00:36.130 --> 00:38.400
It's a small island country.

00:38.400 --> 00:43.100
The covetous, great ancient country of Kouran conducted a sudden invasion

00:43.100 --> 00:46.070
and plundered a third of the land.

00:46.070 --> 00:48.940
Our ally, the great country to the east, D'natia,

00:48.940 --> 00:52.880
defended settlements where they had their bases, then kept silent.

00:52.880 --> 00:55.720
The two great countries quickly carved away Nil Kamui's lands

00:55.720 --> 00:59.390
like meat from a sacrificial swine.

00:59.390 --> 01:05.890
Our guardian deity, Red Dragon, didn't protect the land.

01:05.890 --> 01:08.800
Imperial Era 3015, September...

01:08.800 --> 01:13.230
Our country was no longer ours.

01:13.230 --> 01:18.010
<i>The heat-haze shimmers, ember-toned</i>

01:18.010 --> 01:22.440
<i>Its blurred afterimage far away</i>

01:22.440 --> 01:24.570
<i>(I'm back in this life)</i>

01:35.360 --> 01:44.700
<i>My shout added to the noise</i> <i>and disappeared into the chaos</i>

01:44.700 --> 01:45.700
<i>(Don't wait)</i>

01:45.700 --> 01:47.800
<i>One single life I choose to end</i>

01:47.800 --> 01:50.870
<i>In every breath I take it ends</i>

01:50.870 --> 01:53.110
<i>One single life I choose to end</i>

01:53.110 --> 01:55.310
<i>In every breath I take it ends</i>

01:55.310 --> 01:59.550
<i>Defiling even this chosen fate</i>

01:59.550 --> 02:05.790
<i>With the blood of judgment</i>

02:05.790 --> 02:11.290
<i>"If I can just solve this unraveling</i> <i>moment with my own hands"</i>

02:11.290 --> 02:16.360
<i>I howled enough to burn my life out</i>

02:16.360 --> 02:22.040
<i>I left my hopes to an</i> <i>undependable past and vanished</i>

02:22.040 --> 02:27.640
<i>Cruelly enough, my voice was beautiful</i>

02:27.640 --> 02:31.680
<i>The ending world</i>

02:31.680 --> 02:36.550
<i>I'll be a judgment light</i>

02:44.030 --> 02:48.000
"Nil Kamui \ Orphanage on

02:44.030 --> 02:48.000
the outskirts of Shuka"

02:47.530 --> 02:51.490
Now, then! The time to begin our combined expedition is finally here!

02:52.830 --> 02:55.870
Um, tomorrow we'll leave Shuka and head

02:55.870 --> 03:00.710
to the city of Haiga, where there's supposed to be someone familiar with Red Dragon!

03:00.710 --> 03:02.080
Right?

03:02.080 --> 03:03.750
Exactly.

03:03.750 --> 03:05.550
I'm surprised you didn't forget that.

03:05.550 --> 03:08.080
Yeah, my memory is pretty good!

03:08.080 --> 03:13.120
By the way, I feel like we should improve our intercommunication.

03:13.120 --> 03:16.560
How about we grab something to eat in town here in Shuka before we go on our mission?

03:16.560 --> 03:17.890
--I'm sorry.
--Huh?

03:17.890 --> 03:22.420
There's someplace I want to go, so please head to town ahead of me.

03:27.370 --> 03:32.040
I am sorry, but I feel we are not in a position to associate with you in such a manner as yet.

03:32.040 --> 03:33.630
Now, if you'll excuse us.

03:40.220 --> 03:42.620
Why, I'd be happy to join you.

03:45.620 --> 03:48.560
Good for you, Sir Sweallow.

03:48.560 --> 03:53.830
Meryl, I'm not trying to get to know her personally.

03:53.830 --> 03:55.060
It's for the mission.

03:55.060 --> 03:57.470
I understand.

03:57.470 --> 04:01.600
While I go drinking with her, see what you can find out about her, will you?

04:06.410 --> 04:07.680
Understood.

04:07.680 --> 04:08.940
Now, then...

04:08.940 --> 04:10.110
And...

04:10.110 --> 04:11.600
Huh?

04:16.920 --> 04:20.320
I'm sorry, but could you lend me money to pay for the drinks?

04:23.860 --> 04:25.830
Enjoy your time with her.

04:30.700 --> 04:35.040
Mashiro... Kai... May you rest in peace.

04:35.040 --> 04:37.710
Fugaku went to see Agito.

04:37.710 --> 04:39.040
Agito?

04:39.040 --> 04:41.280
He's the leader of the revolutionary army.

04:41.280 --> 04:44.110
And I'm your escort.

04:44.110 --> 04:45.840
Revolutionary army...

04:48.820 --> 04:52.010
"Shuka \ Urban district"

04:53.490 --> 04:55.720
Lou... was it?

04:55.720 --> 05:02.060
I wanted to ask, but is that large and important-looking piece your weapon?

05:02.060 --> 05:03.530
Weapon?

05:03.530 --> 05:05.830
No, not quite.

05:05.830 --> 05:08.070
It is a weapon, and yet it's not.

05:08.070 --> 05:10.040
This here is my life.

05:10.040 --> 05:13.170
Then, in other words, it's a weapon you can't use carelessly.

05:13.170 --> 05:15.800
Is it some sort of heirloom, or...

05:20.150 --> 05:22.550
Does it interest you that much?

05:22.550 --> 05:24.040
Ah, no.

05:30.530 --> 05:35.060
Well, I just don't do well with tools.

05:35.060 --> 05:37.730
Nine out of ten times...

05:40.840 --> 05:45.770
No... Ninety-nine out of a hundred times, they break if I try to use them.

05:47.010 --> 05:49.340
I see.

05:49.340 --> 05:52.780
I've never been attached to any tool before.

05:52.780 --> 05:57.720
That's why I wanted to know why you said that it was your life, Lou.

06:00.560 --> 06:03.360
It just crossed my mind, that's all.

06:03.360 --> 06:06.260
People don't choose tools.

06:08.130 --> 06:10.800
Tools choose the people.

06:10.800 --> 06:15.540
Are you telling me that your weapon chose you?

06:15.540 --> 06:18.940
It seems you don't know the joy of being chosen...

06:18.940 --> 06:23.380
Could it be that the tools do not like you?

06:25.780 --> 06:26.480
"Curse" "Consumption"

06:26.910 --> 06:27.280
"Bankruptcy"

06:27.280 --> 06:27.820
"Ruin"

06:27.280 --> 06:27.820
"Distinguished Noble"

06:27.820 --> 06:28.420
"Despair" "Dark Contract"

06:27.820 --> 06:28.420
"Rumors"

06:28.420 --> 06:28.920
"Black Dragon Knight"

06:28.920 --> 06:29.750
"Equivalence" "Attendant"

06:29.750 --> 06:30.280
"Equality"

06:30.280 --> 06:30.920
"Stereotype" "Resignation"

06:30.280 --> 06:30.920
"Imprisonment"

06:30.920 --> 06:31.490
"Destruction" "Tools"

06:30.920 --> 06:31.490
"Synergy"

06:31.490 --> 06:31.890
"Understanding" "Free Will"

06:31.490 --> 06:31.890
"Moderation"

06:31.490 --> 06:31.890
"Moment"

06:31.890 --> 06:32.250
"Definition" "Death" "Revival"

06:36.260 --> 06:39.920
Tools not liking me, eh?

06:42.660 --> 06:50.170
"Meanwhile...

06:42.660 --> 06:50.170
Shuka \ Business district"

06:43.660 --> 06:46.070
Is this your store?

06:46.070 --> 06:51.510
Yes, it's a Sherbet Company branch store under my operation.

06:51.510 --> 06:55.140
I thought you were Sweallow's attendant.

06:55.140 --> 06:58.980
Technically, yes, but there's more to it than being an attendant.

06:58.980 --> 07:03.750
I'm actually managing Sir Sweallow's assets after he went bankrupt.

07:08.660 --> 07:11.960
Now then, I'll have the rest of the luggage transported.

07:11.960 --> 07:13.960
Let's have something to eat before we return.

07:13.960 --> 07:15.450
Yes, that's...

07:16.860 --> 07:21.530
Thank you, but I'll return to the inn by myself.

07:31.510 --> 07:34.520
Like, y'know, I told 'em that...

07:34.520 --> 07:36.280
Ow! The hell...

07:36.280 --> 07:37.390
The heck ya doing...?!

07:37.390 --> 07:40.320
Hey, stop it. That's a Bound One.

07:40.320 --> 07:42.790
Nothing to be gained from getting involved with them.

07:42.790 --> 07:49.700
Besides, they got stuck with monsters, so it's not like they got much time to live.

07:49.700 --> 07:53.570
The owner shoulda thrown her in a cell or somethin'!

07:55.970 --> 07:59.670
"Shuka \ Front of the main gate"

08:01.980 --> 08:04.010
Look at 'em!

08:04.010 --> 08:05.510
We're going to be riding them, right?

08:05.510 --> 08:06.510
Indeed.

08:06.510 --> 08:08.420
Yeah, amazing!

08:08.420 --> 08:11.880
See, Ibuki? Those beasts are called Gadanans.

08:13.590 --> 08:15.520
I see...

08:15.520 --> 08:19.490
Ah, um... Did I say something bad?

08:19.490 --> 08:24.170
Maybe he's discontent with joining the expedition.

08:24.170 --> 08:27.240
Well, he's the one who said he wanted to join.

08:27.240 --> 08:29.370
So, where are we supposed to go again?

08:29.370 --> 08:31.910
Have you already forgotten what you said yesterday?

08:31.910 --> 08:34.030
I'm good at forgetting things!

08:41.280 --> 08:44.790
Right now, we're here in Shuka.

08:44.790 --> 08:48.390
Our destination is towards the south-- the neutral city of Haiga.

08:48.390 --> 08:52.960
There's a certain person there that is said to be the friend of Red Dragon.

08:52.960 --> 08:57.360
His name is Ka Grava, also known as the "Undead Merchant."

08:59.100 --> 09:01.540
Haiga is owned by him.

09:01.540 --> 09:06.410
Actually, five percent of all the wealth in this world is supposedly owned by him.

09:06.410 --> 09:12.110
In any case, we need to extract information from him about Red Dragon.

09:20.090 --> 09:22.260
Now then, I'll leave the rest to you, Miska.

09:22.260 --> 09:23.720
No problem!

09:23.720 --> 09:25.130
Good.

09:25.130 --> 09:27.760
The combined expedition departs now!

09:29.060 --> 09:33.000
"Shuka \ Prison"

09:31.770 --> 09:36.630
Wouldn't joining forces with Kouran and D'natia make us vulnerable to their manipulation?

09:38.970 --> 09:44.510
Kouran won't exterminate Ibuki so long as he's part of the expedition.

09:44.510 --> 09:48.020
That buys us time to prepare ourselves.

09:48.020 --> 09:50.590
You're being too optimistic.

09:50.590 --> 09:53.620
And once the expedition gets on its way...

09:53.620 --> 09:59.630
...Ibuki will naturally be drawn closer to
Red Dragon--in other words, to his roots.

09:59.630 --> 10:01.860
Trust me here.

10:01.860 --> 10:03.830
Please support Ibuki.

10:03.830 --> 10:05.320
Understood.

10:09.040 --> 10:14.670
Now then... I wonder who will be burned by Red Dragon's flames.

10:34.030 --> 10:37.900
"Nil Kamui \ Yuunagi Village"

10:44.670 --> 10:48.410
Red Dragon did this throughout the land...?

10:48.410 --> 10:50.500
I need to hurry and do something about this.

11:07.360 --> 11:08.850
Val!

11:13.230 --> 11:14.670
Eykha!

11:14.670 --> 11:16.270
Run!

11:16.270 --> 11:18.710
But your friend is hurt!

11:18.710 --> 11:20.680
Just get out of here!

11:20.680 --> 11:22.170
Behind you!

11:35.020 --> 11:36.420
Eykha...

11:36.420 --> 11:40.230
The next time you're in danger, raise your voice.

11:40.230 --> 11:43.290
My job is to protect you, after all.

11:46.070 --> 11:48.400
Is it only because Agito told you to do so?

11:50.240 --> 11:54.410
Please let me ride on your friend's back...

11:54.410 --> 11:56.100
That's not the only reason.

11:58.450 --> 11:59.940
I'm sorry...

12:04.820 --> 12:08.590
"The Two Great Countries \ The ancient country

12:04.820 --> 12:08.590
of Kouran is known for being the origin

12:04.820 --> 12:08.590
of civilization. On the other hand, D'natia is

12:04.820 --> 12:08.590
a rather new country with only about two

12:04.820 --> 12:08.590
hundred years of history, but they swiftly

12:04.820 --> 12:08.590
expanded their territories and came to

12:04.820 --> 12:08.590
rule the eastern half of the Central Ocean."

12:18.730 --> 12:20.970
It's okay, Meryl...

12:20.970 --> 12:23.840
This isn't a marriage fraud like the other girl before... Ow!

12:23.840 --> 12:25.970
Please wake up, Sir Sweallow.

12:27.610 --> 12:30.840
Isn't it normal to wake someone up by saying something instead of just hitting them?

12:32.110 --> 12:35.240
I've put together a report regarding Lou Chun Wah.

12:36.780 --> 12:38.320
Let's see now...

12:38.320 --> 12:41.320
"An assassin associated with Kouran's secret society, the Eight Claw Clan.

12:41.320 --> 12:44.090
As an assassin, she is highly skilled..."

12:44.090 --> 12:50.200
Oh, come on... Her title is way unfitting to be part of the Red Dragon expedition.

12:50.200 --> 12:53.870
What shall we do? We'll be entering
Kouran territory by tomorrow.

12:53.870 --> 12:55.640
Now is the time to do something about it.

12:55.640 --> 12:58.440
What to do, eh?

12:58.440 --> 13:02.610
It's not like Lou is against us, you know?

13:02.610 --> 13:04.150
Besides...

13:04.150 --> 13:08.320
...in terms of having an unfitting title, we're not any better.

13:08.320 --> 13:10.810
I do have orders from Black Dragon, after all.

13:12.150 --> 13:14.850
To kill Red Dragon...

13:19.690 --> 13:24.200
Lou, this island is filled with worthy prey to feed off of.

13:24.200 --> 13:25.900
Yes, my lord.

13:25.900 --> 13:29.970
I will most certainly offer to you the best among the prey.

13:29.970 --> 13:34.310
The Child of Contract, the Black
Dragon Knight, and finally...

13:34.310 --> 13:36.170
...Red Dragon...

13:44.920 --> 13:48.880
"Nil Kamui \ Jinrai prefecture"

13:52.890 --> 13:55.500
Guess we'll be staying here overnight.

13:55.500 --> 13:59.030
Jinrai is the acting base for
Kouran's occupation forces.

13:59.030 --> 14:02.990
Lou is gathering information, so let's wait for her return.

14:04.540 --> 14:06.510
That's right...

14:06.510 --> 14:10.580
Ibuki, can you please take this meal to Eykha?

14:10.580 --> 14:12.050
Me?

14:12.050 --> 14:16.520
She's like your friend, right?

14:16.520 --> 14:18.080
Friend...

14:22.720 --> 14:24.250
No, she's not...

14:36.100 --> 14:38.740
I brought you some food.

14:38.740 --> 14:41.280
I'm fine with the same thing Val eats.

14:41.280 --> 14:44.380
Same...? But you're a human.

14:44.380 --> 14:46.610
That's not what the others say.

14:46.610 --> 14:49.920
A Bound One refers to a human bound to a monster.

14:49.920 --> 14:51.890
I'm the revolutionary army's weapon.

14:51.890 --> 14:54.120
Right now, I'm your blade.

14:54.120 --> 14:57.390
But that's so wrong...

14:57.390 --> 15:00.490
You're saying the same thing that Mashiro told me.

15:00.490 --> 15:04.130
It's not like those like me live for very long.

15:04.130 --> 15:05.620
Mashiro...

15:07.430 --> 15:10.230
This was back when I joined the revolutionary army.

15:14.940 --> 15:18.250
I'm sorry, but this is all I have right now.

15:18.250 --> 15:20.950
Thank you...

15:20.950 --> 15:23.980
But I can't repay you.

15:25.590 --> 15:27.520
Eykha, you're strong, right?

15:28.860 --> 15:32.690
If so, please join me in protecting my friend.

15:32.690 --> 15:38.630
You're Mashiro's friend, so I'll protect you.

15:38.630 --> 15:43.300
But I killed Mashiro...

15:43.300 --> 15:46.940
Red Dragon sought your friend...

15:46.940 --> 15:49.010
...and so Mashiro responded.

15:49.010 --> 15:54.110
If that's the case, I'm not going to make friends anymore...

16:03.120 --> 16:06.560
So Haiga is surrounded by Kouran's forces, it seems.

16:06.560 --> 16:08.800
A bit of a bother, don't you think, Lou?

16:08.800 --> 16:11.400
I'm a member of the expedition, my lord.

16:11.400 --> 16:14.030
The military's intention is not my concern.

16:17.300 --> 16:19.670
Oh, my, who could it be?

16:19.670 --> 16:21.740
Lou Chun Wah, I presume.

16:21.740 --> 16:25.680
I've come to take vengeance for my lady, General Kohkaku.

16:25.680 --> 16:30.680
No matter what secret assignment you have, it doesn't change the treason you've committed!

16:30.680 --> 16:32.190
What timing, Lou.

16:32.190 --> 16:35.190
I was starting to feel the pangs of hunger.

16:35.190 --> 16:37.560
Yes, my lord...

16:37.560 --> 16:41.860
It is quite vexing to have ones such as them barring our way.

16:56.110 --> 16:57.780
Satisfy yourselves...

16:57.780 --> 17:01.870
This is the last blade you will be seeing in your life.

17:06.850 --> 17:08.690
So beautiful...

17:08.690 --> 17:10.560
It's mine...

17:12.430 --> 17:16.060
That blade is worthy of me...!

17:16.060 --> 17:17.260
No.

17:17.260 --> 17:19.390
My lord is mine alone...

17:34.050 --> 17:36.780
Ah, that was quite satisfying, Lou.

17:37.820 --> 17:40.450
That is good to hear.

17:53.070 --> 17:57.000
"Nil Kamui \ Haiga outskirts"

17:56.140 --> 18:00.570
Lady Gakusho, it seems the city of Haiga still has ample supplies.

17:58.010 --> 18:03.980
"Kouran force encampment"

18:00.570 --> 18:04.180
On the other hand, our supplies are starting to dwindle.

18:04.180 --> 18:07.150
It's been about a month since we surrounded them.

18:07.150 --> 18:11.150
We better do something about this before D'natia gets involved.

18:11.150 --> 18:14.420
Then let us take Haiga before that happens.

18:14.420 --> 18:18.130
Yeah, we've got to pay back what's due to the Undead Merchant.

18:18.130 --> 18:20.150
I'll drill him full of holes!

18:22.860 --> 18:26.100
It looks like Haiga is completely surrounded.

18:26.100 --> 18:28.440
I thought that city took a neutral stance?

18:28.440 --> 18:30.440
From what I garnered at Jinrai,

18:30.440 --> 18:33.840
it seems they are suspected of helping to fund the revolutionary army.

18:33.840 --> 18:35.810
That's not all.

18:35.810 --> 18:40.980
Word is that D'natia's forces led by Lady Ulrika are headed here.

18:40.980 --> 18:45.440
In other words, it's only a matter of time until the city turns into a battlefield.

18:46.490 --> 18:49.360
Our country's concern for its social standing isn't going to help.

18:49.360 --> 18:51.130
That said...

18:51.130 --> 18:55.160
Word is that the Undead Merchant's manor is located near Haiga's precipitous coastline,

18:55.160 --> 18:57.300
making it much like a fortress.

18:57.300 --> 19:01.240
That means we'll need to come up with a plan to get into the place.

19:01.240 --> 19:04.570
One, we can wait for conflict to arise between D'natia and Kouran's forces,

19:04.570 --> 19:07.040
then make our way into the city.

19:07.040 --> 19:09.140
Isn't that a bit bothersome?

19:09.140 --> 19:13.580
Two, we can try to negotiate earnestly through company venues.

19:13.580 --> 19:17.350
If that brought results, Kouran would've resolved the conflict by now.

19:17.350 --> 19:20.720
Then three would be infiltration.

19:20.720 --> 19:23.320
That I can do, so long as I move alone.

19:23.320 --> 19:26.820
Ah! Can you take me with you?!

19:27.830 --> 19:29.500
You, Ibuki?

19:29.500 --> 19:30.860
Yes!

19:30.860 --> 19:34.070
If an Imperial with strong ties with Red Dragon is there,

19:34.070 --> 19:37.770
the Undead Merchant may listen to what we have to say.

19:37.770 --> 19:40.010
So, please!

19:40.010 --> 19:43.210
I see... Well, let's go, shall we?

19:43.210 --> 19:47.550
You and me are friends after all, right, Ibuki?

19:47.550 --> 19:49.950
W-We're not friends, really...

19:54.250 --> 19:58.290
I need to meet Red Dragon as soon as possible.

19:58.290 --> 20:01.790
I'm not going to let anyone else get dragged into misery...

20:04.360 --> 20:06.370
Well, now, here we go.

20:06.370 --> 20:07.470
Huh?

20:07.470 --> 20:08.960
Wha--?!

20:10.300 --> 20:12.570
W-Wait! Please put me down!

20:12.570 --> 20:14.370
I can scale the wall myself!

20:14.370 --> 20:17.540
No talking, or else you'll bite your tongue.

20:34.060 --> 20:35.500
"Nil Kamui \ Haiga \ Ka Grava's manor"

20:42.840 --> 20:44.170
What is this place...?

20:44.170 --> 20:48.730
Structurally speaking, I believe this is supposed to be this manor's lord's room.

20:49.780 --> 20:51.650
Such an unusual room...

20:50.340 --> 20:54.080
"Living room"

20:51.650 --> 20:54.310
It doesn't feel like anyone lives here.

20:57.520 --> 21:00.250
Didn't something move just now?

21:00.250 --> 21:01.850
I didn't notice anything.

21:07.430 --> 21:09.460
--Lou!
--Yes?

21:09.460 --> 21:12.130
Um, well...

21:12.130 --> 21:15.760
Ibuki, it's not good to tease adults.

21:23.780 --> 21:27.280
Good morning, strangers.

21:27.280 --> 21:31.720
I am Ka Grava Rai Fuu Gramstahl.

21:31.720 --> 21:33.320
You're...

21:33.320 --> 21:35.690
The Undead Merchant?

21:35.690 --> 21:39.230
Hm, indeed.

21:39.230 --> 21:41.860
Now then, why don't you both join me for breakfast...?

21:43.130 --> 21:45.570
Sounds good, yes?!

21:45.970 --> 21:46.400
"Act 3"

21:47.370 --> 21:50.670
"Act 3 \ Three as One"

21:57.640 --> 22:02.880
<i>The end I thought I'd chosen;</i> <i>though the melody may warp (more)</i>

22:02.880 --> 22:07.850
<i>At last the pounding heartbeat</i> <i>desires it and performs</i>

22:07.850 --> 22:13.090
<i>Both the evened-out impulse</i> <i>and the wiped-out lament (now)</i>

22:13.090 --> 22:19.560
<i>Are wings that race onward,</i> <i>tearing through the fog</i>

22:32.910 --> 22:42.860
<i>Emotions that can't be hidden in words</i> <i>that push people away (bleeding through)</i>

22:42.860 --> 22:48.060
<i>Emptying both hands so I can get what I want</i>

22:48.060 --> 22:55.560
<i>If I can't even find fault</i> <i>with this unshrinking expanse</i>

22:56.770 --> 22:58.310
<i>What am I supposed to believe?</i>

22:58.310 --> 23:02.480
<i>I need nothing if I have you:</i>
<i>That alone is enough</i>

23:02.480 --> 23:12.480
<i>Go on and cry: You burn so bright because</i> <i>the gears of transmigration are turning</i>

23:12.620 --> 23:22.620
<i>Tightly spin together the intertwining roads</i> <i>to which your shouts led you</i>

23:26.970 --> 23:27.430
"Act 4"

23:27.230 --> 23:30.570
Act 4: "Amid Enemies."

23:30.570 --> 23:32.940
Haiga is about to be engulfed in warfare.

23:32.940 --> 23:37.180
The time draws near for the anguished Ibuki to make a new choice.

23:37.180 --> 23:40.240
Who will he kill, and who will he save?
